{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:52 2026-08-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:52 2026-08-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:52 2026-08-28 HKT</p><p>今（28日）晨10時35分，一輛密斗貨車駛進3號貨櫃碼頭南路二號迴旋處期間，車頭突然起火，司機及時棄車逃生，車頭迅即陷入火海，三號幹線離遠也看見黑煙升上半空。消防接報到場出動一喉一煙霧隊，至11時37分將火救熄，事件中無人受傷。</p><img alt=\"貨車陷入火海。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/13810f9eef59870daa55c8844475454e/2026-08/01_3_25.jpg\"/><img alt=\"貨車陷入火海。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b5fa040d0b3e42ef23f9ecd0d0eadc0/2026-08/02_4_32.jpg\"/><img alt=\"三號幹線見到黑煙升上半空。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c51e860d15992c34f5ea52594fe524e8/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_12_11_50.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"貨車陷入火海。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26b2d80279dd3735a9ed4eee4bea4e60/2026-08/04_7_21.jpg\"/><img alt=\"三號幹線見到黑煙升上半空。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6af809357f0154db042352de7f49745a/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_12_13_25.jpeg\"/><p>現場所見，貨車車尾載有一盒盒的新冷氣機貨物，消防到場由車尾搬出貨物射水灌救，近一小時將火救熄。</p><img alt=\"消防開喉撲救。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/62ace0525e4086a29e7e89361179a8db/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_12_11_49_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"車尾冒出濃煙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6cb6fd343ce81d4aa2d5218d16e38604/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_12_11_49.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防開喉撲救。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6142ff502b8d0abe7108876fdaa6e997/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_12_11_48.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防搬出貨物救火。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/001c0c38abd5c02cfba969fd9b5490d7/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_12_11_47_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防開喉撲救。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc4aa69dc7da7a30407afacbab07c980/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-28_at_12_11_46_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T04:39:54.503511+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":245,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}